<section><p class="eyebrow">THE DESIGN</p><h2>What makes Triple Bristle different?</h2><p>Most toothbrushes use a single brushing surface that you move from one side of a tooth to another. Triple Bristle's distinctive brush head uses three sides to contact multiple surfaces during brushing. It pairs that approach with sonic brushing technology. The design may appeal to shoppers looking for a different way to manage their daily routine, but it does not eliminate the need for careful brushing along the gumline or regular flossing.</p></section>
<section><p class="eyebrow">THE BUY BETTER BREAKDOWN</p><h2>Reasons to consider it—and reasons to compare</h2><div class="cards"><div><h3>Why it caught our eye</h3><p>The three-sided brush head is an unusual alternative to a conventional sonic toothbrush. It is worth comparing if you are interested in how brush-head design affects your routine.</p></div><div><h3>Who may like it</h3><p>Shoppers who prefer electric toothbrushes, are curious about multi-surface brushing, or want to explore a different brush-head shape.</p></div><div><h3>What to consider</h3><p>The head may feel unfamiliar at first. Confirm replacement-head cost and availability, included accessories, return terms, and the exact model before ordering.</p></div></div></section>
<section><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU BUY</p><h2>Five things worth checking</h2><ol><li><strong>Brush-head fit:</strong> Is the three-sided head comfortable for your mouth and brushing technique?</li><li><strong>Replacement heads:</strong> How often are replacements recommended, and what do they cost?</li><li><strong>Model features:</strong> Compare the included settings, charging method, timer, and accessories for the exact model.</li><li><strong>Routine:</strong> A different brush shape does not replace twice-daily brushing, cleaning between teeth, or dental visits.</li><li><strong>Price and policies:</strong> Check the current promotion, warranty, shipping, and return conditions before checkout.</li></ol></section>
